sequenceDiagram
  participant GA as GitHub Actions
  participant REG as GHCR
  participant SRV as Server
  participant DB as Oracle
  GA->>REG: push image tag sha-abc1234
  GA->>SRV: ssh, run deploy.sh with tag
  SRV->>SRV: remember OLD_TAG from .env, set IMAGE_TAG to new tag
  SRV->>REG: docker compose pull backend
  SRV->>SRV: docker compose up -d backend
  SRV->>DB: Flyway applies pending migrations on startup
  SRV->>SRV: poll /v3/api-docs up to 90 s
  alt healthy
    SRV-->>GA: exit 0, deploy OK
  else unhealthy
    SRV->>SRV: restore OLD_TAG and restart backend
    SRV-->>GA: exit 1, pipeline fails
  end
